  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">與任何官方賽車系列無關。</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px\">需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>（推薦），或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> + <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>，方能支援自訂模型與材質。</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">若您想支持我們的創作，可在材質包內的「License」檔案中找到我們的贊助連結 (buycoffees)。</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Mercedes 安全車</span><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">所有帶儲物的船（含竹製儲物筏）</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">oak_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Ferrari 1, 2</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">BMW Sauber 3, 4</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">spruce_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Toro Rosso 14, 15<br></span><br>（適用於 1.20-1.21.3 版本）<br><em><br>Toyota 11, 12</em><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">birch_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Renault 5, 6</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">jungle_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">RedBull 9, 10</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">acacia_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">McLaren 22, 23</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">dark_oak_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Honda 16, 17</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">cherry_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Force India 20, 21</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">mangrove_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Williams 7, 8<br></span><br><br><br><stron